    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75217" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρνῑθ-ιᾰκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
